#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:104
msgid "LibreTranslate address:"
msgstr "Adresse de LibreTranslate :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:112
msgid "An Ollama server (better, but slower)"
msgstr "Un serveur Ollama (meilleur, mais plus lent)"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:117
msgid "Ollama address:"
msgstr "Adresse d'Ollama :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:125
msgid "Ollama model:"
msgstr "Modèle Ollama :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:133
msgid "Ollama prompt:"
msgstr "Prompt Ollama :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:151
msgid ""
"{language} and {code} become the language to translate into (français, fr), "
"{lines} the lyrics as numbered lines. The answer must keep the numbers, as "
"\"number| translation\"."
msgstr ""
"{language} et {code} deviennent la langue cible (français, fr), {lines} les "
"paroles en lignes numérotées. La réponse doit garder les numéros, sous la "
"forme \"numéro| traduction\"."

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:157
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Par défaut"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:165
msgid "No machine translation"
msgstr "Pas de traduction automatique"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:171
msgid "Also send the lyrics Deezer provides to Google"
msgstr "Envoyer aussi à Google les paroles fournies par Deezer"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:179
msgid ""
"Deezer's lyrics are licensed from LyricFind for personal use. The "
"LibreTranslate or Ollama server you set up always translates them, Google "
"only with this option. Lyrics from LRCLIB are always translated."
msgstr ""
"Les paroles de Deezer sont sous licence LyricFind, pour un usage personnel. "
"Le serveur LibreTranslate ou Ollama que vous avez installé les traduit "
"toujours, Google seulement avec cette option. Les paroles de LRCLIB sont "
"toujours traduites."

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:184
msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Cache"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:188
msgid "Kept translations:"
msgstr "Traductions gardées :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:197
#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigStorage.qml:67
msgid "Empty"
msgstr "Vider"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigServices.qml:210
msgid "Only the translations are kept, never the lyrics themselves."
msgstr "Seules les traductions sont gardées, jamais les paroles elles-mêmes."

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigStorage.qml:55
msgid "Web cache"
msgstr "Cache web"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigStorage.qml:59
msgid "Size now:"
msgstr "Taille actuelle :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigStorage.qml:62
msgid "Measuring…"
msgstr "Mesure en cours…"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigStorage.qml:77
msgid "Limit:"
msgstr "Limite :"

#: package/contents/ui/config/ConfigStorage.qml:90
msgid ""
"The Deezer page caches what it loads, like any browser: mostly tracks "
"(encrypted) and covers. Above the limit, the oldest files go. Emptying it "
"does not sign you out."
msgstr ""
"La page Deezer garde en cache ce qu'elle charge, comme tout navigateur : "
"surtout des morceaux (chiffrés) et des pochettes. Au-delà de la limite, les "
"fichiers les plus anciens partent. Le vider ne vous déconnecte pas."

